        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "Lead source: web_form\nZIP code: 32207\n<inquiry>\nFound mud tubes running up the wall in the garage this weekend and theres a bunch of little wings on the window sill by the back door. Pretty sure its termites?? We've only been in the house 2 yrs and nobody ever told us if it has a bond or whatever. Can someone come look at it this week. We own the place. Thanks\n</inquiry>"
